	affiliations = {Toyohashi University of Technology, Toyohashi, 441-8580, Japan},
	abstract = {UML 1.3 has made a pair of changes concerning the use-case relationships; one is to move include and extend that used to be stereotypes of the generalization into those of the dependency, and the other is to introduce a true generalization. A use-case generalization, however, is practically useless and therefore the changes are rather worsening the situation. The ACU of Actors-Call-Use-cases conjecture, which is actually against the definition of a use case, is found buried in OOSE, It distorts the features of use-case objects and is the root cause of the problems. Strictly following the definition of a use case, a real-world model is built that represents a typical situation of using a use case in the analysis and design stages, and a use case is reified as an ordinary object. The use-case specification thus constructed successfully solves the problems.},
